|---|---|---|---|
| \`background\` | \`#ffffff\` · \`oklch(1 0 0)\` | \`#0a0a0a\` · \`oklch(0.145 0 0)\` | Default app background. |
| \`foreground\` | \`#0a0a0a\` · \`oklch(0.145 0 0)\` | \`#fafafa\` · \`oklch(0.985 0 0)\` | Default text on background. |
