Contrast, measured (WCAG 2.2: text ≥ 4.5:1, UI parts ≥ 3:1):

| Pair | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| \`foreground\` on \`background\` | 19.79:1 ✓ | 18.96:1 ✓ |
| \`muted-foreground\` on \`background\` | 4.73:1 ✓ | 7.63:1 ✓ |
| \`muted-foreground\` on \`muted\` | 4.34:1 ✗ | 5.83:1 ✓ |
| \`primary-foreground\` on \`primary\` | 4.95:1 ✓ | 4.95:1 ✓ |
| \`secondary-foreground\` on \`secondary\` | 16.42:1 ✓ | 14.48:1 ✓ |
| \`tv-soft-fg\` on \`tv-soft-bg\` | 4.51:1 ✓ | 4.51:1 ✓ |
| \`tv-primary-text\` on \`background\` | 5.17:1 ✓ | 4.98:1 ✓ |
| \`primary\` on \`background\` (fill edge) | 5.17:1 ✓ | 3.83:1 ✓ |
| \`ring\` on \`background\` | 2.59:1 ✗ | 4.18:1 ✓ |
| \`tv-line\` on \`background\` | 3.28:1 ✓ | 3.01:1 ✓ |

## Typography

- \`font-sans\`: Inter, for all UI and body text.
- \`font-heading\`: Inter, for h1–h3 and display text.
- \`font-mono\`: JetBrains Mono, for code and tabular figures.
- Load Inter, JetBrains Mono from Google Fonts (\`next/font/google\` in Next.js).

| Role | Classes |
|---|---|
| Display | \`font-heading text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight\` |
| Headline | \`font-heading text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight\` |
| Title | \`font-heading text-xl font-semibold\` |
| Body | \`text-base\` |
| Small / UI | \`text-sm\` |
| Label | \`text-sm font-medium\` |
| Caption | \`text-xs text-muted-foreground\` |

## Layout

Density is **default**. Spacing unit \`--spacing\` = 4px.

| Measure | Value | Class |
|---|---|---|
| Control height (button, input, select) | 36px | \`h-9\` |
| Control padding | 16px | \`px-4\` |
| Gap between controls | 12px | \`gap-3\` |
| Card padding | 24px | \`p-6\` |
| Table row height | 40px | \`h-10\` |

## Elevation & Depth

Cards and panels have a 1px \`border-border\` edge and no shadow. Popovers, menus and dialogs always keep a border and \`shadow-lg\`, in every style.

The shadow scale (\`shadow-2xs\` … \`shadow-2xl\`) grows from one base shadow, 0px 1px 3px 0px at 10% opacity. \`shadow-sm\` is \`0px 1px 3px 0px oklch(0 0 0 / 10%), 0px 1px 2px -1px oklch(0 0 0 / 10%)\`.

In dark mode, surfaces get lighter as they rise (\`background\` → \`card\` → \`popover\`); borders are white overlays. Don't add \`dark:\` colour overrides: the variables already switch.

## Shapes

\`--radius\` = 10px. Scale: \`rounded-sm\` 6px, \`rounded-md\` 8px, \`rounded-lg\` 10px, \`rounded-xl\` 14px, \`rounded-2xl\` 18px, \`rounded-3xl\` 22px, \`rounded-4xl\` 26px.

- Buttons and badges: \`rounded-lg\` (10px).
- Inputs and selects: \`rounded-md\`.
- Cards: \`rounded-xl\`. Popovers and menus: \`rounded-lg\`.

## Components

Built on shadcn/ui. Differences from the stock components (\`components/ui/*\`):

- **Button** sizes: default \`h-9 px-4\`; shape \`rounded-lg\` on every variant (replace \`rounded-md\`).
- **Primary button** (default variant): \`bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\` (stock). Secondary, ghost and destructive keep their stock colours.
- **Input, Textarea, Select trigger**: \`h-9\`, \`border border-input bg-transparent\` (stock).
- **Card**: \`border\` (stock), \`rounded-xl\`, padding \`p-6\`.
- **Tabs**: stock shadcn: a \`bg-muted\` track; the active trigger is \`bg-background shadow-sm\`.
- **Focus** (all interactive parts): a 3px halo: \`focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50\` (stock shadcn).
- Links and primary-coloured text: \`text-tv-primary-text\`, not \`text-primary\` (as text, primary is under 4.5:1 in dark mode; this token is the passing shade).
- **Charts**: series colours \`chart-1\` … \`chart-5\`, in order.
- **Status**: \`bg-success text-success-foreground\`, \`warning\`, \`info\` likewise; errors use \`destructive\`.

\`\`\`tsx
<Card>
  <CardHeader>
    <CardTitle className="font-heading">Invite your team</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>They'll get an email with a link.</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent className="flex gap-3">
    <Input placeholder="name@company.com" />
    <Button>Send invite</Button>
  </CardContent>
</Card>
\`\`\`

## Do's and Don'ts

- Do: Pair every surface with its foreground token.
- Do: Use \`font-heading\` for headings, \`font-sans\` elsewhere.
- Do: Check both modes: toggle the \`.dark\` class on \`<html>\`.
- Don't hardcode colours (\`#hex\`, \`oklch()\`, \`bg-blue-500\`, \`text-gray-600\`): use the tokens above, so dark mode and re-theming keep working.
- Don't add \`dark:\` colour variants: every token already has a dark value.
- Don't give buttons \`rounded-md\`; they are \`rounded-lg\`.
- Don't put shadows on cards; the border is the edge.
- Don't put \`text-muted-foreground\` on coloured fills; it is measured against \`background\`, \`card\` and \`muted\` only.

## Agent Prompt Guide

Paste this when asking an AI tool for UI:

> Build it with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS v4, following DESIGN.md (theme "Untitled"): vivid blue brand, rounded solid buttons, outline inputs, border cards, default density. Use only the theme's tokens (\`bg-primary\`, \`text-muted-foreground\`, \`border-border\`…), never raw colours. Support light and dark mode.

## Using this file

- Claude Code: add \`@DESIGN.md\` to \`CLAUDE.md\`.
- Cursor: \`.cursor/rules/design.mdc\` with \`alwaysApply: true\` and the body \`@DESIGN.md\`.
- GitHub Copilot: \`.github/instructions/design.instructions.md\` with \`applyTo: "**/*.{tsx,jsx,css}"\` and the body "Follow DESIGN.md".
- Codex, Jules and other AGENTS.md readers: add "Follow DESIGN.md for all UI." to \`AGENTS.md\`.
- Google Stitch: import this file as the project's design system.

Source: https://thevio.zubyr.dev/studio?t=1N4IgbiBcCMC+Q
"
`;
